  data: {
    LLM: "If you hold the 3 of Spades (Kaiser), your goal is to lose it to your OPPONENTS. If you hold the 5 of Hearts, protect it until your partner leads a winning Ace.\n\nThe 'Low Lead': Lead a low spade early to force out the Aces and Kings, making it easier to see where the 3 of Spades might fall later in the hand.\n\nBidding 'Low': Sometimes teams bid 7 (the minimum) even with a strong hand to play defensively and force the other team to take the Kaiser.",
